_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/0c1210276a3b23205ff8d11ae2cc6629.poster.avif?t=1754491649\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/0c1210276a3b23205ff8d11ae2cc6629.webm?t=1754491649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/0c1210276a3b23205ff8d11ae2cc6629.mp4?t=1754491649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant handcrafted world where forests, weather, and seasons shift around you. Influence the land through your actions, watch the world respond, and uncover the ancient magic that pulses beneath every stone and tree.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/0b67008120eb1de6a9c711aacbae20c9.webp?t=1754491649\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/651f41ea0c9c61451d3db4da1c87df32.poster.avif?t=1754491649\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/651f41ea0c9c61451d3db4da1c87df32.webm?t=1754491649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/651f41ea0c9c61451d3db4da1c87df32.mp4?t=1754491649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Band together with up to 8 players in seamless co-op. Build unique parties, tackle challenges from different angles, and return for new adventures. Whether you forge your story alone or with friends, every journey will be your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2402680/extras/c56b351e4fd6e3e8280d877975f09900.webp?t=1754491649\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dimraeth is in active development toward Early Access. A new playtest is planned for Fall 2025, with Early Access launching in Fall 2026. Wishlist and follow us to get updates, early access to content, and help shape the future of Dimraeth with our community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
